    "description": "This hand-shaped bot scurries like a spider. It functions as a detachable hand for a cyberarm, though it is sometimes used by uplifts or other morphs who need a hand design for certain tasks. Its \"legs\" are more articulated than human fingers and can rotate/bend in any direction. Though this bot does not have the leverage of a full arm/body behind it, it can extend a meter-long brace for stabilization and support.",
